w_plain: decl assign 0, explicit scalared 0, explicit vectored 0
w_assign: decl assign 1, explicit scalared 0, explicit vectored 0
ws: decl assign 0, explicit scalared 1, explicit vectored 0
wv: decl assign 0, explicit scalared 0, explicit vectored 1
ws: net bits 4, each with the vpiExpanded of the net 1
wv: net bits 4, each with the vpiExpanded of the net 1
wst: decl assign 1, strength0 vpiStrongDrive, strength1 vpiPullDrive
tcs: charge strength vpiSmallCharge
tcl: charge strength vpiLargeCharge
w_plain: parent NULL 1, constant select 1
a bit of ws: constant select 1
an[1] by index: constant select 1
right-hand side of y1: net 1, constant select 1
right-hand side of y2: net 1, constant select 0
